---
title: "Apple and Blue Cheese On Endive"
cookTime: 30 minutes
totalTime: 30 minutes
source.name: Taste of Home
source.url: "http://www.tasteofhome.com/recipes/Apple---Blue-Cheese-on-Endive"
tags: ["Appetizer"]
---

In a small bowl, combine @lemon juice{1%tablespoon} and @water{1%tablespoon}.
Add @red apple{1}(large, finely chopped) and toss to coat. 
Drain and pat dry.

Combine the apple, @celery{2%ribs}(finely chopped), @crumbled blue cheese{3/4%cup} and @mayonnaise{3%tablespoons}.
Spoon 1 tablespoonful onto each @Belgian endive{4%heads}(separated into leaves) leaf.
Sprinkle with @hazelnuts{1/2%cup}(toasted, chopped).
